{"name":"Intergalactic","hex":"#4d516c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"intergalactic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Occurring between galaxies.","Occurring across a single galaxy, interstellar."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/intergalactic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Intergalactic (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Intergalactic\" is a song by the American hip-hop group Beastie Boys. It was released on June 22, 1998 as the lead single from their fifth studio album, Hello Nasty (1998). The single reached number 28 on the US Billboard Hot 100, making it the band's third and final top-40 single, and number five on the UK Singles Chart, where it remains the band's biggest hit. It received a Grammy Award for Best Rap Performance by a Duo or Group at the 1999 Grammy Awards."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d0/BeastieBoysIntergalacticSingle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intergalactic_(song)","wikidata":"Q6046503"},{"title":"Intergalactic (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Intergalactic is a British science fiction television series created by Julie Gearey. It follows a crew of fierce convicts who break free and go on the run. The series premiered on 30 April 2021 on Sky One. In August 2021, Sky cancelled the show after one series."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Intergalactic_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q106512256"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/Intergalactic.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/09/Intergalactic.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIntergalactic.png"}],"sounds":{"intergalactic":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b